{"id":"cul-ci","cat":"culture","type":"文学","name":"宋词","era":"两宋","year":960,"endYear":null,"ptype":null,"birth":null,"death":null,"summary":"宋代最具代表性的文学体裁，与唐诗并称。分婉约、豪放两大风格，有令、引、近、慢等体制。","tags":["词","长短句","一代之文学"],"groups":[],"minor":false,"detail":"词本为配乐歌唱的“曲子词”，经五代发展至宋而极盛。柳永、苏轼、周邦彦、李清照、辛弃疾、姜夔等大家辈出，词从艳科小道升为抒情言志的正统文体。","body":null,"refs":null,"categoryName":"文化","createdAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","updatedAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","related":[{"id":"cul-huajian","name":"花间词派与《花间集》","cat":"culture"},{"id":"emp-nantang-houzhu","name":"南唐后主 李煜","cat":"people"},{"id":"lit-bijimanzhi","name":"《碧鸡漫志》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-caotangshiyu","name":"《草堂诗余》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-cilun","name":"《词论》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-huajian","name":"《花间集》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-baishi","name":"《白石道人歌曲》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-bishan","name":"《碧山乐府》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-caochuang","name":"《草窗词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-dongpo","name":"《东坡乐府》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-dongshan","name":"《东山词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-dongze","name":"《东泽绮语债》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-duanchang","name":"《断肠词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-fangweng","name":"《放翁词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-fanwenzheng","name":"《范文正公诗余》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-houcun","name":"《后村长短句》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-huaihai","name":"《淮海居士长短句》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-jiaxuan","name":"《稼轩长短句》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-liuyi","name":"《六一词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-longchuan","name":"《龙川词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-longzhou","name":"《龙洲词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-meixi","name":"《梅溪词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-mengchuang","name":"《梦窗词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-pianyu","name":"《片玉集》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-shangu","name":"《山谷琴趣外篇》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-shanzhong","name":"《山中白云词》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-ji-shuyu","n